---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import BackLink from "../../components/BackLink.astro";
import { legalEntity } from "../../data/legal";
---

<Layout
	lang="en"
	title="Cookie policy | Zaviren"
	description="Which cookies zaviren.com uses, why, and how to manage your consent."
	altHref="/cookies"
>
	<section class="legal">
		<span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
		<h1>Cookie policy</h1>
		<p class="updated">Last updated: 2026-08-11</p>
		<p class="legal-note">
			This is an informational translation. The Spanish version is the
			legally binding one. See <a href="/cookies">Política de cookies</a>.
		</p>

		<h2>1. What cookies are</h2>
		<p>
			Cookies are small files stored in your browser when you visit a
			website. They help remember information about your visit, such as
			preferences or, for analytics cookies, how the site is being used.
		</p>

		<h2>2. Cookies we use</h2>
		<p><strong>{legalEntity.domain}</strong> uses the following cookies:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Consent preference (necessary):</strong> we store your
				choice to accept or reject analytics cookies in your browser's
				local storage (technically not a cookie, but serves the same
				purpose). No consent is required since it's strictly necessary
				for the banner to work.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Google Analytics (analytics, optional):</strong> if you
				accept analytics cookies, we use Google Analytics (Google Ireland
				Ltd.) to measure aggregate site visits and usage. It sets cookies
				such as <code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_*</code> and <code>_gid</code>, lasting up to 2 years. More information in <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's privacy policy</a>.
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>We do not use advertising cookies or third-party cookies for commercial purposes.</p>

		<h2>3. Legal basis</h2>
		<p>
			Analytics cookies are only activated if you consent through the
			banner shown on your first visit. You can reject them without
			affecting your ability to browse the site.
		</p>

		<h2>4. Managing your consent</h2>
		<p>
			You can change your decision at any time by clearing this site's
			browsing data/local storage in your browser. The banner will
			appear again on your next visit. You can also block or delete
			cookies from your browser settings (Chrome, Firefox, Safari and
			Edge usually offer this under "Privacy and security").
		</p>

		<h2>5. More information</h2>
		<p>
			For more detail on how we handle your data, see our <a href="/en/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
		</p>

		<BackLink lang="en" />
	</section>
</Layout>
